# 🔌 Proposed API Endpoints

### Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register user |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login user |
| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | Logout user |

### Donors

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/donors/register` | Register donor |
| GET | `/api/donors` | Retrieve donors |
| GET | `/api/donors/search` | Search donors |
| PUT | `/api/donors/availability` | Update availability |

### Blood Requests

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/api/blood-requests` | Create request |
| GET | `/api/blood-requests` | Retrieve requests |
| GET | `/api/blood-requests/:id` | Retrieve request details |
| PUT | `/api/blood-requests/:id/status` | Update request status |

### Blood Banks

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/blood-banks` | Retrieve blood banks |
| GET | `/api/blood-banks/:id` | Retrieve blood bank details |
| GET | `/api/blood-inventory` | Retrieve inventory |
| PUT | `/api/blood-inventory/:id` | Update inventory |

### Admin

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/admin/users` | Manage users |
| PUT | `/api/admin/verify/:id` | Verify user |
| GET | `/api/admin/reports` | Retrieve reports |

---

# 🔐 Security and Privacy

MediConnect is designed to handle personal information responsibly.

The proposed security measures include:

- Password hashing.
- JWT-based authentication.
- Role-based access control.
- Input validation.
- Secure API endpoints.
- Protected database access.
- Environment variables for API credentials.
- Verification of donors and organizations.
- Rate limiting.
- Audit logs.
- Secure handling of personal contact information.

Personal donor information should not be publicly exposed without appropriate consent.

