# ⚠️ Limitations and Medical Disclaimer

MediConnect is intended to facilitate blood donation coordination and information management.

The application does not replace professional medical advice or authorized blood bank procedures.

Blood compatibility, donor eligibility, medical suitability, and actual blood availability must be confirmed by qualified healthcare professionals or authorized blood banks.

The platform should not guarantee donor availability or blood compatibility based solely on database records.

